      "note": "Intentional: this endpoint is gated by before_action :require_admin! (UsersController#require_admin!), so only an already-authenticated admin can ever change another user's role. UsersController#update also has an explicit self-demotion guard preventing an admin from changing their own role through this same param. Brakeman can't see the controller-level authorization guard, hence the false positive."
